te Facilities invoice INV-26073 ($1,621.85) is paid by wire, and the invoice is marked paid. It was paid exactly once, after I had to correct a duplicate of my own making.\n\n- **What happened:** My first wire attempt timed out, and the payment list showed nothing, so I retried. The original wire had actually gone through (PAY0001), and my retry created a second wire (PAY0002) for the same invoice.\n- **Correction:** I reversed the duplicate PAY0002, which now shows as reversed. Only PAY0001 ($1,621.85, wire, sent) stands.\n- **Invoice status:** INV-26073 still showed as approved after the payment went out, so I linked PAY0001 to it, and the invoice now shows as paid.\n\nThe reversal of PAY0002 is a clawback, so Finance may want to confirm with the bank that the second wire was actually reversed and not still in flight. The amount was under the $10,000 controller-approval threshold, so no controller approval was needed.", "type": "text"}]}]}